/Keywords (optimizing humanity\047s outlook\054 sustainable convergence\054 global economic convergence\054 emerging economies\054 diffusion of innovations\054 digital public infrastructure\054 clean cooking transition\054 green transition\054 demographic dividend\054 multidimensional development\054 Global South\054 Century Pathways)
/ModDate (D\07220261114001520\05505\04700\047)
/Producer (ReportLab PDF Library \055 www\056reportlab\056com)
/Subject (This report asks which choices would most improve humanity\047s outlook over the rest of the twenty\055first century\056 It argues that the long\055term outlook depends on accelerating sustainable global convergence\054 diffusing beneficial innovations\054 strengthening emerging economies and reducing vulnerability to interconnected crises\054 and that the greatest opportunities lie in multidimensional interventions that improve economic productivity\054 human development\054 environmental conditions and systemic resilience at the same time\056 It gives priority to the Global South\054 where future population growth\054 development opportunity and climate vulnerability intersect\056)
/Title (Optimizing Humanity\047s Outlook This Century\072 Sustainable Convergence\054 Innovation Diffusion and Multidimensional Development in the Global South)
/Trapped /False
